 "description": "Find and replace fill/stroke colors of paths and text characters across the document or within a specific layer. replacedCount counts replaced path fills/strokes; textFramesChanged counts text frames in which at least one character color was replaced (text strokes with weight 0 are ignored). Every replacement is read back; matches that could not be replaced (e.g. locked) are listed in failed and make success false. A layer scope includes groups and sublayers inside it. from_color must be cmyk or rgb and matches only objects whose current color is stored in that same color type (check with get_colors) \u2014 an RGB from_color does not match CMYK-colored objects. to_color can be any type, e.g. replace an RGB color with a CMYK one. Spot, gray, gradient and pattern colors are never matched.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
